ship = GI-3 ''Griffin'' OUF
version = 1.0.4
description = The GI-3 "Griffin" One Use Fighter is designed to sacrifice everything else to deliver an extremely fast, maneurverable, light weight, and cheap fighter.¨¨Takeoff:¨1. Spool both engines at least 50%, disengage from launcher.¨¨"Landing":¨1. Deactivate engines.¨2. Bring craft to low speed, low altitude (40 m/s @ 50 m).¨3. Engage EL chute, keep nose up as much as possible.¨¨Action groups:¨1. Basic jet toggle.¨2. Turbo jet toggle.¨0. EL drogue chute.¨¨Abort cuts engines and toggles intakes.
type = SPH
size = 8.141253,15.78363,6.079383
